          "der Kollege → die Kollegin (colleague)",
          "",
          "PRONUNCIATION NOTE:",
          "-in is unstressed; the stress stays put:",
          "LEH-rer → LEH-re-rin, Stu-DENT → Stu-DEN-tin.",
          "",
          "SHORTHAND NOTATION:",
          "In this course, professions appear as Lehrer/in,",
          "Arzt/Ärztin, Student/in - meaning that both",
          "the masculine and feminine forms exist.",
          "",
